{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LumenKnight is a roguelike survival game where every run tests your reflexes and strategy. Face waves of enemies, dodge lethal attacks, and time your strikes to prove your skill in intense combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135160/extras/034233f3e5dd68de77e4f9ab6fa60893.poster.avif?t=1772961413\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135160/extras/034233f3e5dd68de77e4f9ab6fa60893.webm?t=1772961413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135160/extras/034233f3e5dd68de77e4f9ab6fa60893.mp4?t=1772961413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a new challenge: pick a character with a unique power and create your own build to fight your way. Combine different skills to grow stronger and prepare for the bosses waiting at the end. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135160/extras/4196b982945a2a9006e39ee5fa3cb580.poster.avif?t=1772961413\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135160/extras/4196b982945a2a9006e39ee5fa3cb580.webm?t=1772961413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135160/extras/4196b982945a2a9006e39ee5fa3cb580.mp4?t=1772961413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn enemy patterns, master your moves, and push your limits to survive as long as you can. Are you ready to rise stronger with every run?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video c